# CleanField / Usarya SCS-100 stone picker - hopper lifting and tipping together (side view), for drawings.
# The lifting parallelogram of cases/lift_*.mech carries the tipping joint of cases/tip_*.mech; two cylinders
# working in parallel are modelled as one with twice the piston area. Reference configuration: hopper lowered,
# as on assembly drawing 345-0.0.0 (sheet 2). Origin at the lower-arm pivot A (RCa1 of cases/lift_*.mech). Units mm, kg.
title Usarya stone picker - hopper lifting and tipping
body low up cpl hopper
revolute A ground low 0.0 0.0
revolute B ground up -435.7080 858.0096
revolute C low cpl -1053.1080 -1383.3288
revolute D up cpl -1488.8160 -525.3192
revolute E cpl hopper -1652.5152 -322.4592
actuator lift ground -79.3800 -549.6624 low -882.3528 -1373.4504 bore=141.421 rod=84.853 min=1150.388 max=1890.388 mass=164
actuator tip cpl -1348.4016 -589.8816 hopper -403.2504 -300.5856 bore=141.421 rod=70.711 min=988.435 max=1588.435
mass hopper hopper -441.3152 -842.8592 740
mass frame cpl -1270.9620 -954.3240 100
mass upper_arms up -962.2620 166.3452 72
mass lower_arms low -526.5540 -691.6644 96
label low lower arm
label up upper arm
label cpl rear frame
label hopper hopper
